        "Content": "3 BEDROOM,   3 BATHROOM,   SEMI,   GFCH,   84sqm,  C2,   uPVC DG WINDOWS,   SOUTH FACING REAR GARDEN\r\nNB: SEE VIRTUAL TOUR\r\nHogan Estates are delighted to present No. 14 Beechdale Place, a superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home extending to approximately 84 sq.m. (904 sq.ft.), ideally positioned within this highly sought-after residential development in the heart of Ballycullen, Dublin 24.\r\nThis bright and well-proportioned home has been designed with modern family living in mind and offers spacious accommodation throughout. The property benefits from gas fired central heating, uPVC double glazed windows, and a sunny south-facing rear garden, providing an ideal outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining guests, or enjoying family time throughout the day.\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room, a modern kitchen/dining area with direct access to the rear garden, and a guest WC on the ground floor. Upstairs there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite, together with a well-appointed family bathroom. The property's practical layout and excellent natural light make it an ideal purchase for first-time buyers, growing families, or investors seeking a quality home in an established and convenient location.\r\nBeechdale Place enjoys an enviable position close to a wide range of local amenities. Residents are within easy reach of Woodstown Shopping Centre, Knocklyon Shopping Centre, The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght, Dundrum Town Centre, Lidl, SuperValu, Tesco and a variety of cafés, restaurants and everyday retail services.\r\nFamilies are exceptionally well catered for with an excellent choice of both primary and secondary schools nearby, including Gaelscoil Chnoc Liamhna, Firhouse Educate Together National School, St Colmcille's Community School, Sancta Maria College, Firhouse Community College, and Ballycragh National School. Third-level institutions including TU Dublin Tallaght Campus and University College Dublin are also easily accessible.\r\nFor those with an active lifestyle, the area offers an abundance of sporting and recreational amenities. Nearby facilities include Ballyboden St. Enda's GAA Club, St Anne's GAA Club, Thomas Davis GAA Club, Knocklyon United Football Club, local tennis clubs, golf courses including The Grange Golf Club and Edmondstown Golf Club, together with the extensive walking and cycling trails of the Dublin Mountains, Marlay Park, St. Enda's Park, and Tymon Park, all of which are just a short drive away.\r\nThe locality also offers a wealth of cultural and leisure attractions including Rua Red Arts Centre, The Civic Theatre Tallaght, Tallaght Library, and numerous community facilities, cafés and restaurants throughout the Ballycullen, Firhouse and Tallaght areas.\r\nTransport links are excellent, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas particularly convenient. Dublin Bus routes serving the area include the 15, 15B, 49, 65 and 65B, providing regular services to the city centre and surrounding suburbs. The nearby Luas Red Line at Tallaght provides fast and reliable access to the city centre, while the M50 motorway (Junction 12 and Junction 13) is only minutes away, connecting to all major national road networks including the N7, N81 and M11. Dublin Airport is also easily accessible via the M50.\r\nCombining spacious accommodation, a desirable south-facing rear garden, excellent energy-efficient features and an outstanding location close to every conceivable amenity, No. 14 Beechdale Place represents an exceptional opportunity to acquire a quality family home in one of Dublin 24's most popular residential locations.\r\nEmail HOGAN ESTATES today as early viewing is highly recommended."
      }
